      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 7
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light",
      "usage": {
        "type": "worn"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "316f6412-5a15-56f2-8a74-cfb8cee294f8",
    "pack": "knights-of-lastwall",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:undead-compendium",
    "name": "Undead Compendium",
    "level": 14,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "knights-of-lastwall"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The best minds among the Magaambyan, Iomedaean, and Pharasmin Knights of Lastwall joined together to create these small, leather-bound journals. While you're holding an "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "undead compendium",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", the information it contains slips into your mind, granting you a +2 item bonus to Recall Knowledge checks to obtain information about undead creatures."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 10 minutes (envision, Interact; auditory, linguistic)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You study the journal, focusing on a specific type of undead creature, and as the information fills the pages, you recite it aloud to your allies. Select ghost, ghoul, graveknight, lich, mummy, vampire, wight, or zombie. You and up to four allies that hear you read the information aloud during the activation gain a +2 item bonus on attack rolls and saving throws against that type of undead for the next 10 minutes. To benefit from the bonus, your allies must listen attentively and can't perform any other activities during the activation time."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:religion"],
        "type": "item",
        "value": 2,
        "predicate": ["action:recall-knowledge", "target:trait:undead"]
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.4yUa5JicrhnHUggC"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 6300
        }
      },
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "undead-compendium",
          "name": "Undead Compendium",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "9c65333c-11be-5a65-91f6-c163005ebe5a",
    "pack": "knights-of-lastwall",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:whistle-of-calling",
    "name": "Whistle of Calling",
    "level": 15,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "knights-of-lastwall"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "whistle of calling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " appears to be a simple brass whistle. It changes slightly in appearance depending on the type of creature to which it's attuned, depicting small carvings of hooves, feather patterns, claws, or other appropriate motifs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 10 minutes (Interact)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You blow the whistle at different tones in the presence of a companion or another allied creature willing to be your mount. At the end of the 10 minutes, the whistle is attuned to that creature. The whistle can be attuned to only one creature at any time, but you can attune it to a new one with another 10-minute activation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Interact"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You blow the whistle and the creature to which it is attuned teleports instantly from as far as 1 mile away to an unoccupied space within 30 feet of you. The whistle has no effect if the attuned creature is dead, on another plane, or outside the range."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
